        "text": "History limitation: the twelve fetched official rates are rounded to whole percentages in the snapshot tables. Attempts to fetch the underlying CSV and filtered CMS API rows failed, so exact original ex parte counts and one-decimal historical shares could not be obtained. HistoricalContext preserves the fetched table values without inventing precision; dispersion calibration is approximate."
